-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Cyclone
  Publisher   Vortex, 1985
  Version     1.2

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Cyclone (1985)(Vortex)[a][a].z80
  MD5         2f151f785c1b3727cf3187aec2111f76

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Pace        original (+0.19% measured in JNext 1.1.104 headless on the
              NextZXOS v2.09 card, against the plain build of the same file;
              input keyed to game updates (probe 0x5B67, Kempston), game state
              checked at every update, 3 seeds)

  Changes     1.1: works on NextZXOS v2.10 (System/Next 26.11)
              1.2: plays at the original's pace (1.1 ran about 16 percent
              slow); the helicopter and aircraft no longer lag a frame behind
              the scenery

  Note        Works on NextZXOS v2.10 from 1.1. From 1.2 it plays at the
              original's pace: three measured runs came to +0.2%, +0.1% and
              -1.0% against the original (1.1: +16.6%), in JNext, 2026-11-07.
              Known issues: the pace evens out over a few game updates rather
              than update by update: in one run the slowest 20-update stretch
              was 7.6% behind and the quickest third 2.3% ahead. Missing: no
              Enhanced colour set; on this release's file the replay check did
              not reach the cyclone, crates, landing or game over (the
              engine's own recordings with aircraft, a crash and game over
              replay identically); hardware untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Infinite time
   3  Infinite fuel
   4  Immune to cyclone
   5  No crashes

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

