  Coverage    1.2 changes the hooks (the renderer runs at 28 MHz in a pace
              window; patterns double-buffered) and the start-up stub (the
              v2.10 fix-ups now made by the builder); the game's own banks,
              the loading screen and the cheats are as in 1.1. 1.1 changes
              only the start-up stub: after its copy of the running ROM3 into
              the alt ROM it puts v2.09's bytes back at 11 sites where that
              ROM3 holds v2.10's (BEEPER, PLOT, POINT, DRAW, CIRCLE); on v2.09
              nothing changes; POINTERS (0x1664) is left as v2.10 has it. 1.0:
              No aircraft in the replays (unit cases only), no cyclone,
              crates, landing or game over. About 35 code and data bytes
              differ from the engine's own snapshot, including two INC HL at
