              held with; Infinite fuel: simulator (pulsed climb, lives held,
              20000 frames): fuel bar steps in 43 of 49 in-flight ticks
              without, 0 of 58 with; post-crash drain loop exits (no hang),
              game over still reached without the lives harness; Immune to
              cyclone: simulator (seed 1, lives held, 20000 frames): cyclone
              buffet routine 7378 runs 41 frames (4 push-downs) without; 0
              with, though in range 129 frames; No crashes: simulator (3 key
              schedules, 8000 frames): crash flag 7505 never set and no
              helicopter lost with; 3 lost in each without (frames
              shots/cy_nocrash.png: still flying at 5000)

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
